  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cocoa Coalition Ghana</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands and Ghana have a  common interest in transforming the cocoa value chain into a viable business proposition for farmers and processors, with sustainable supply management, addressing issues such as deforestation, child labour and a living income, attracting Dutch companies and making the sector attractive for youth. The Netherlands believe that to address the mentioned issues, the cocoa sector needs partnerships and a holistic, systemic approach. With the help of a coalition led by the embassy, the partners will adopt a new approach to do less but better and more flexibly to achieve a systemic change.</narrative>
  </description>
